01:25:43.042 --> 01:25:45.042
To be lazy while being humble.

465
01:25:45.042 --> 01:25:47.042
Do you understand what I mean?

466
01:25:47.042 --> 01:25:49.042
Now we go to 1 Corinthians chapter 14.

467
01:25:49.042 --> 01:25:55.042
Because I want to continue with our thesis that the Holy Spirit,

468
01:25:55.042 --> 01:25:58.042
the languages of the Holy Spirit are in us,

469
01:25:58.042 --> 01:26:02.042
not just what happened in Acts chapter 2,

470
01:26:02.042 --> 01:26:04.042
the speaking in pure languages,

471
01:26:04.042 --> 01:26:07.042
but it is indeed speaking in languages that you do not understand.

472
01:26:07.042 --> 01:26:10.042
We are going to read that now in chapter 14.

473
01:26:10.042 --> 01:26:18.042
Do your utmost to be filled with this love from 1 Corinthians chapter 13.

474
01:26:18.042 --> 01:26:22.042
Also desire the gifts of the Spirit.

475
01:26:22.042 --> 01:26:25.042
Especially to prophesy.

476
01:26:25.042 --> 01:26:27.042
For if you, here we go,

477
01:26:27.042 --> 01:26:30.042
for if you speak in a language of the Spirit,

478
01:26:30.042 --> 01:26:33.042
you are not speaking to people.

479
01:26:33.042 --> 01:26:37.042
So there we already have the tackling of Acts chapter 2

480
01:26:37.042 --> 01:26:43.042
for the rational people who say that it is only in French, German, Dutch, Spanish.

481
01:26:43.042 --> 01:26:48.042
There it says, for you do not speak to people.

482
01:26:48.042 --> 01:26:51.042
That people receive it in their own way through the Spirit,

483
01:26:51.042 --> 01:26:53.042
that is the wonder of the Spirit.

484
01:26:53.042 --> 01:26:57.042
But it is not speaking to people, that is what it says.

485
01:26:57.042 --> 01:27:01.042
But to whom? To God.

486
01:27:01.042 --> 01:27:04.042
Here it comes again, for no one understands it.

487
01:27:04.042 --> 01:27:10.042
Speaking in the tongues of the Spirit is understood by no one, you do not understand it either.

488
01:27:10.042 --> 01:27:16.042
For by the Spirit you speak hidden things.

489
01:27:16.042 --> 01:27:21.042
But when you prophesy, you say things that build up the faith of the people.

490
01:27:21.042 --> 01:27:25.042
Robert, I speak about you in the name of Jesus.

491
01:27:25.042 --> 01:27:29.042
That no matter how old you are, God has new things for you.

492
01:27:29.042 --> 01:27:31.042
I prophesy over your life.

493
01:27:31.042 --> 01:27:37.042
That God will give you new revelations that go so deep that you have never heard before.

494
01:27:37.042 --> 01:27:39.042
Not from anyone here in this room.

495
01:27:39.042 --> 01:27:42.042
God will show you new things from God's Word.

496
01:27:42.042 --> 01:27:45.042
And I want to bless you with that in the name of Jesus.

497
01:27:45.042 --> 01:27:46.042
This is prophecy.

498
01:27:46.042 --> 01:27:49.042
Prophecy is bringing Robert closer to the Lord.

499
01:27:49.042 --> 01:27:56.042
Prophecy is not saying Robert, I believe that you will soon be flying a Boeing 747...

500
01:27:57.042 --> 01:27:59.042
Give me a break.

501
01:27:59.042 --> 01:28:02.042
Build each other up, it says here.

502
01:28:02.042 --> 01:28:05.042
Yes, I would like a Boeing. I don't want a Boeing at all.

503
01:28:05.042 --> 01:28:08.042
Do you know, such a thing costs a fortune.

504
01:28:08.042 --> 01:28:11.042
And the maintenance on it.

505
01:28:11.042 --> 01:28:17.042
It encourages them and speaks courage into them.

506
01:28:17.042 --> 01:28:24.042
When you speak in a language of the Holy Spirit, you build yourself up.

507
01:28:24.042 --> 01:28:28.042
But when you prophesy, you build up the congregation.

508
01:28:28.042 --> 01:28:30.042
Are you all following along?

509
01:28:30.042 --> 01:28:34.042
I find this really super interesting.

510
01:28:34.042 --> 01:28:38.042
So when you speak in a language of the Holy Spirit, you build yourself up.

511
01:28:38.042 --> 01:28:42.042
When I gather here on Monday evenings and we are praying here.

512
01:28:42.042 --> 01:28:45.042
And Vanessa and I have been talking about this over the past week.

513
01:28:45.042 --> 01:28:53.042
We want to serve the congregation in the most correct way possible with as much of the Holy Spirit as possible.

514
01:28:53.042 --> 01:28:57.042
And so I don't want to be a church where it is too quiet and still.

515
01:28:57.042 --> 01:29:01.042
And at the same time, I also want there to be order.

516
01:29:01.042 --> 01:29:03.042
And how do we deal with that?

517
01:29:03.042 --> 01:29:10.042
That is one of those conversations that Vanessa and I can enjoy having from morning till evening.

518
01:29:10.042 --> 01:29:13.042
Because we want to do that well.

519
01:29:13.042 --> 01:29:19.042
Verse 5. I would like all of you to speak in languages of the Holy Spirit.

520
01:29:19.042 --> 01:29:21.042
Did you see what I just did?

521
01:29:21.042 --> 01:29:23.042
At the beginning of this speech.

522
01:29:23.042 --> 01:29:30.042
I want, says Paul, I want you all to speak in the languages of the Spirit.

523
01:29:30.042 --> 01:29:32.042
I do not have my own opinion.

524
01:29:32.042 --> 01:29:35.042
My opinion is in sync with the Bible.

525
01:29:35.042 --> 01:29:39.042
So I want everyone in open church to speak in the languages of the Spirit.

526
01:29:39.042 --> 01:29:41.042
That is what Paul says to the Corinthians.

527
01:29:41.042 --> 01:29:43.042
That is what I am now saying to the church.

528
01:29:43.042 --> 01:29:47.042
But I would much rather that you prophesy.

529
01:29:47.042 --> 01:29:56.042
For if someone prophesies, that is at that moment more useful and important than a message in a language of the Spirit.

530
01:29:56.042 --> 01:30:02.042
But if someone who speaks in a language of the Spirit also explains what he says, that is good too.

531
01:30:02.042 --> 01:30:04.042
For then it is prophecy.

532
01:30:04.042 --> 01:30:07.042
For then it also builds up the congregation.

533
01:30:07.042 --> 01:30:15.042
Suppose, brothers and sisters, that I come to visit you and speak to you only in a language of the Spirit.

534
01:30:15.042 --> 01:30:18.042
What good is that to you? For you do not understand it.

535
01:30:18.042 --> 01:30:20.042
So I will argue once more.

536
01:30:20.042 --> 01:30:25.042
Praying in the languages of the Spirit is a language that no one understands.

537
01:30:26.042 --> 01:30:30.042
Isn't it better if I tell you something that God has just shown me?

538
01:30:30.042 --> 01:30:32.042
Or teaches you things that you do not yet know.

539
01:30:32.042 --> 01:30:36.042
Or we prophesy to you or teach about the Word.

540
01:30:36.042 --> 01:30:38.042
It is just like with musical instruments.

541
01:30:38.042 --> 01:30:42.042
Suppose, for example, that a flute and a harp make the same sound.

542
01:30:42.042 --> 01:30:46.042
How can you then know what is being played on the flute and on the harp?

543
01:30:46.042 --> 01:30:51.042
And suppose the trumpet makes an unclear sound.

544
01:30:51.042 --> 01:30:52.042
Yes, I think so too, Paul.

545
01:30:52.042 --> 01:30:55.042
Then no one prepares for battle.

546
01:30:55.042 --> 01:30:57.042
So it is with you.

547
01:30:57.042 --> 01:31:04.042
If you speak incomprehensible things in the languages of the Holy Spirit, no one benefits from it.

548
01:31:04.042 --> 01:31:10.042
It would be as if you were just talking into the air.

549
01:31:12.042 --> 01:31:15.042
Read that verse again. Look above me, verse 9.

550
01:31:17.042 --> 01:31:21.042
Then it is as if you are just talking into the air.

551
01:31:22.042 --> 01:31:28.042
What I want, what Vanessa and I are organizing in Open Church...

552
01:31:28.042 --> 01:31:37.042
...is that there is a sweet flavor of the Holy Spirit demonstrably and noticeably present in the church.

553
01:31:38.042 --> 01:31:46.042
And that we can certainly pray in the Holy Spirit together during worship and prayer moments...

554
01:31:46.042 --> 01:31:51.042
...but that it is a sweet flow of the Holy Spirit.

555
01:31:51.042 --> 01:31:56.042
So that the room is filled with the worship of the believers...

556
01:31:56.042 --> 01:32:04.042
...and that when I stand next to Robert and Robert is in the sound, in the harmony of the musical instruments and the people...

557
01:32:04.042 --> 01:32:09.042
...God is being glorified and Robert does that in his own Dutch language and at that moment says...

558
01:32:09.042 --> 01:32:14.042
...Lord, I love you so much. Thank you that you have forgiven me for my sin.

559
01:32:14.042 --> 01:32:19.042
And if I stand next to him and I am praying in the languages of the Holy Spirit...

560
01:32:19.042 --> 01:32:28.042
...that there is harmony. That it is beautiful there. That it is not arrogant and self-building.

561
01:32:28.042 --> 01:32:32.042
It is not for me to showcase myself to the congregation.

562
01:32:32.042 --> 01:32:35.042
Look how well I can pray in the languages of the Spirit.

563
01:32:35.042 --> 01:32:42.042
That is not the function of the languages of the Spirit. It is up to the Lord, says Paul.

564
01:32:42.042 --> 01:32:47.042
Where was I? Verse 10.

565
01:32:47.042 --> 01:32:52.042
There are many kinds of languages in the world. No one knows how many there are.

566
01:32:52.042 --> 01:32:54.042
And each language has its own words.

567
01:32:54.042 --> 01:32:59.042
If I do not know the words of someone's language, I will be a stranger to the person who speaks.

568
01:32:59.042 --> 01:33:05.042
And the speaker will be a stranger to me, for we do not understand each other.

569
01:33:05.042 --> 01:33:10.042
You desire spiritual gifts, but then try to use those gifts as much as possible...

570
01:33:10.042 --> 01:33:14.042
...that build up the faith of the congregation.

571
01:33:14.042 --> 01:33:22.042
Someone who speaks to the congregation in the language of the Spirit must also pray that he will be able to explain it.

572
01:33:22.042 --> 01:33:31.042
For if I speak in a language of the Spirit, my spirit prays, but my mind gains nothing from it.

573
01:33:31.042 --> 01:33:36.042
What should I do then? I must pray with my spirit, but also pray with my mind.

574
01:33:36.042 --> 01:33:42.042
There must be a good cohesion, there must be a good cooperation between the spirit and the mind.

575
01:33:42.042 --> 01:33:49.042
I must praise God with songs from my spirit, but also praise Him with songs from my mind.

576
01:33:49.042 --> 01:33:58.042
For suppose you thank God in a language of the Spirit, how can someone else who is there say amen?

577
01:33:58.042 --> 01:34:03.042
That's right, reciting. He does not know at all what is being said.

578
01:34:03.042 --> 01:34:08.042
For you may be thanking well, but the others gain nothing from it.

579
01:34:08.042 --> 01:34:11.042
I thank, here Paul says something very cool.

580
01:34:11.042 --> 01:34:17.042
Paul says, I thank God that I speak in the languages of the Spirit more than all of you.

581
01:34:17.042 --> 01:34:28.042
Paul is not showing off here, but Paul simply wants to emphasize how important it is that we all practice these gifts of the Spirit.

582
01:34:28.042 --> 01:34:33.042
Dear people, I want to say to Open Church, do it.

583
01:34:33.042 --> 01:34:39.042
Be open to it. Do it. Just say it in your normal prayers to the Lord.

584
01:34:39.042 --> 01:34:46.042
Lord, fill me with your Spirit and show me how I can pray in the languages of the Spirit.

585
01:34:46.042 --> 01:34:50.042
And the Lord will give it. But maybe not right away.

586
01:34:50.042 --> 01:34:57.042
Maybe the Lord will say, Tim, in my case, let's first work on that cursing of yours.

587
01:34:57.042 --> 01:35:02.042
Tim, let's first work on that family situation of yours.

588
01:35:02.042 --> 01:35:07.042
Tim, why don't we first work on that one addiction?

589
01:35:08.042 --> 01:35:16.042
Tim, before I fill myself with you, my Spirit, and I will show you everything about who I am and how I am and what I want to do with you.

590
01:35:16.042 --> 01:35:21.042
Why don't we first push all that uncleanness out of your life?

591
01:35:21.042 --> 01:35:32.042
Let the Holy Spirit do what He wants to do, when He wants to do it, and to what extent He wants to do it.

592
01:35:32.042 --> 01:35:39.042
And all three things that I just mentioned are biblical. You can find them in the Bible.

593
01:35:39.042 --> 01:35:46.042
Even the extent, even the amount, even the volume knob is up to God to direct.

594
01:35:46.042 --> 01:35:52.042
He is at the mixing table. He is God, not us. Amen?

595
01:35:52.042 --> 01:35:59.042
So if He wants to turn up the knob, last week, the last evening of prayer,

596
01:35:59.042 --> 01:36:10.042
somehow I was, I think for about 60 minutes, flooring it minus breath in the languages of the Spirit.

597
01:36:10.042 --> 01:36:15.042
The volume knob was turned up. That doesn't mean I have to shout.

598
01:36:15.042 --> 01:36:20.042
That doesn't mean I have to stick my head out and let everyone know how great I am.

599
01:36:20.042 --> 01:36:25.042
No, that was what we just read, something between me and God.

600
01:36:25.042 --> 01:36:31.042
I enjoyed it. I think also God the Father, because He gave it. I practice it.

601
01:36:31.042 --> 01:36:37.042
And that is how we want to do this in an open church. Speak it out and be open to it.

602
01:36:37.042 --> 01:36:40.042
Which verse? 19.

603
01:36:40.042 --> 01:36:44.042
But in the congregation, I would rather speak five words with my understanding,

604
01:36:44.042 --> 01:36:49.042
so that others can benefit from it than thousands of words in the languages of the spirit.

605
01:36:49.042 --> 01:36:52.042
Brothers and sisters, do not be immature in your thinking.

606
01:36:52.042 --> 01:36:55.042
Be inexperienced in doing bad things. Do you see that?

607
01:36:55.042 --> 01:37:01.042
Ban all sins from your life, church. Ban all sins from your life.

608
01:37:01.042 --> 01:37:05.042
Read this verse again. Read it carefully.

609
01:37:07.042 --> 01:37:14.042
Do not be immature in your thinking. Be inexperienced in doing bad things.

610
01:37:14.042 --> 01:37:18.042
Inexperienced in doing bad things.

611
01:37:18.042 --> 01:37:26.042
Make sure that if you come into contact with people who do many bad things,

612
01:37:26.042 --> 01:37:31.042
your spirit may be allergic to that. That is what I read there.

613
01:37:31.042 --> 01:37:35.042
Inexperienced in doing bad things.

614
01:37:35.042 --> 01:37:40.042
When men, I will just say, talk at the football club about how cool they were,

615
01:37:40.042 --> 01:37:43.042
that they cheated with this and that person.

616
01:37:43.042 --> 01:37:47.042
If all goes well, that should be a shock to your soul.

617
01:37:47.042 --> 01:37:51.042
Wow, that hurts. That shouldn't be. Do you understand what I mean?

618
01:37:51.042 --> 01:37:55.042
That is what Paul means by being inexperienced in doing bad things.

619
01:37:55.042 --> 01:38:01.042
Make sure that if someone even starts gossiping in church about a brother or sister,

620
01:38:01.042 --> 01:38:05.042
well, that person.

621
01:38:05.042 --> 01:38:10.042
Make sure you are inexperienced in that.

622
01:38:10.042 --> 01:38:14.042
That you say, wow, disconnect, short circuit, doesn't add up.

623
01:38:14.042 --> 01:38:16.042
And guys, we do not do this.

624
01:38:16.042 --> 01:38:19.042
Being inexperienced in doing bad things.

625
01:38:19.042 --> 01:38:21.042
Verse 21 in the books says,

626
01:38:21.042 --> 01:38:27.042
Through people with another language and through the mouth of strangers I will speak to this people, the Gentiles.

627
01:38:27.042 --> 01:38:30.042
But still they will not listen to me, says the Lord.

628
01:38:30.042 --> 01:38:34.042
So the languages of the Spirit are a sign,

629
01:38:34.042 --> 01:38:38.042
not for the people who already believe, but for the unbelievers.

630
01:38:38.042 --> 01:38:41.042
And there you have the translation of the gospel again.

631
01:38:41.042 --> 01:38:47.042
But prophecy is not for the unbelievers, but for the believers.

632
01:38:47.042 --> 01:38:48.042
Verse 23.

633
01:38:48.042 --> 01:38:54.042
On the other hand, suppose there are unbelieving people who come into a gathering of the congregation.

634
01:38:54.042 --> 01:38:57.042
I find this a very important verse for Open Church.

635
01:38:57.042 --> 01:39:01.042
If everyone then only speaks in the languages of the Spirit,

636
01:39:01.042 --> 01:39:04.042
and everyone is loud and yelling and making guesses,

637
01:39:04.042 --> 01:39:07.042
will they think you are crazy?

638
01:39:07.042 --> 01:39:16.042
I do not want Open Church to come across as a bunch of lunatics,

639
01:39:16.042 --> 01:39:19.042
listen carefully to what I say,

640
01:39:19.042 --> 01:39:26.042
through the oddities we do to make ourselves look great.

641
01:39:26.042 --> 01:39:30.042
The gospel is already a sharp sword.

642
01:39:30.042 --> 01:39:33.042
The gospel in itself already.

643
01:39:33.042 --> 01:39:35.042
Come to Christ, on Sundays.

644
01:39:35.042 --> 01:39:38.042
And he will cleanse you with his blood.

645
01:39:38.042 --> 01:39:44.042
That is already a message that the unbeliever who comes in will have to accept.

646
01:39:44.042 --> 01:39:47.042
For the gospel is either or.

647
01:39:47.042 --> 01:39:48.042
It is life or death.

648
01:39:48.042 --> 01:39:50.042
It is acceptance or rejection.

649
01:39:50.042 --> 01:39:56.042
And so if I, when an unbeliever is just starting to look at Open Church,

650
01:39:56.042 --> 01:39:59.042
with everything this person has experienced in life,

651
01:39:59.042 --> 01:40:02.042
with the baggage of the pagan they bring along,

652
01:40:02.042 --> 01:40:04.042
and they come into Open Church here,

653
01:40:04.042 --> 01:40:06.042
and they think to themselves, okay, okay,

654
01:40:06.042 --> 01:40:09.042
there was just a greeting at the door, people love me,

655
01:40:09.042 --> 01:40:10.042
the people are happy here,

656
01:40:10.042 --> 01:40:13.042
and then that person stands next to me,

657
01:40:13.042 --> 01:40:15.042
and all of a sudden I explode like an avalanche,

658
01:40:15.042 --> 01:40:17.042
and I make myself completely weird,

659
01:40:17.042 --> 01:40:19.042
and I start acting crazy.

660
01:40:19.042 --> 01:40:21.042
What do you think that person says?

661
01:40:21.042 --> 01:40:29.042
That person has not been able to receive the gospel of Jesus Christ.

662
01:40:30.042 --> 01:40:32.042
And that is why Paul says,

663
01:40:32.042 --> 01:40:40.042
make sure that your behavior is not a deterrent to the other people around you.

664
01:40:43.042 --> 01:40:45.042
I think it's fine, dear church,

665
01:40:45.042 --> 01:40:50.042
if there is someone in Open Church who breaks.

666
01:40:50.042 --> 01:40:54.042
I think it's fine if there is in Open Church,

667
01:40:54.042 --> 01:40:58.042
during a worship, or during a prayer, or during the Word,

668
01:40:58.042 --> 01:41:02.042
that someone is set free by the Holy Spirit at that moment

669
01:41:02.042 --> 01:41:08.042
from chains and addictions, from trauma, from abuse, from occultism.

670
01:41:08.042 --> 01:41:12.042
For all we know, such a person is set free by the Holy Spirit at that moment,

671
01:41:12.042 --> 01:41:15.042
as soon as the Word, the name of Jesus is spoken,

672
01:41:15.042 --> 01:41:19.042
and that someone really has a moment where they break,

673
01:41:19.042 --> 01:41:23.042
and comes to forgiveness of that one difficult person in their family,

674
01:41:23.042 --> 01:41:25.042
and that causes tears,

675
01:41:25.042 --> 01:41:27.042
or even an outcry to God,

676
01:41:27.042 --> 01:41:31.042
and that there is a moment that might startle you.

677
01:41:31.042 --> 01:41:33.042
That's fine, church.

678
01:41:33.042 --> 01:41:37.042
Let us not be a church where nothing is allowed to happen.

679
01:41:37.042 --> 01:41:41.042
But let us understand in love 1 Corinthians chapter 13

680
01:41:41.042 --> 01:41:45.042
that when God intervenes, it is God who intervenes.

681
01:41:45.042 --> 01:41:47.042
That people can be set free,

682
01:41:47.042 --> 01:41:49.042
that people can come to healing,

683
01:41:49.042 --> 01:41:52.042
that people can intercede on a Monday evening,

684
01:41:52.042 --> 01:41:54.042
and can sit at the altar,

685
01:41:54.042 --> 01:41:56.042
just like we did last Monday,

686
01:41:56.042 --> 01:41:58.042
and that there can be weeping,

687
01:41:58.042 --> 01:42:01.042
and that we can say, Holy Spirit, please,

688
01:42:01.042 --> 01:42:04.042
weep Netherlands and Belgium before it goes into the abyss,

689
01:42:04.042 --> 01:42:06.042
with all those sins and all that misery,

690
01:42:06.042 --> 01:42:08.042
and then we can become strong in our prayers,

691
01:42:08.042 --> 01:42:10.042
then there may be sound.

692
01:42:10.042 --> 01:42:14.042
Please do not think that I want to make our church a silent church.

693
01:42:14.042 --> 01:42:17.042
There is joy in the house of the Lord.

694
01:42:17.042 --> 01:42:21.042
But there must be a sweet flavor together with the Holy Spirit,

695
01:42:21.042 --> 01:42:24.042
and we all need to learn to do this.

696
01:42:26.042 --> 01:42:31.042
24. But suppose everyone prophesies and an unbeliever comes in,

697
01:42:31.042 --> 01:42:35.042
then he is convinced by those people that he is a guilty person,

698
01:42:35.042 --> 01:42:37.042
and that he must come to faith.

699
01:42:37.042 --> 01:42:41.042
So prophecy, as I have explained before,

700
01:42:41.042 --> 01:42:44.042
prophecy, also in the Old Testament,

701
01:42:44.042 --> 01:42:49.042
is bringing people back to the Father.

702
01:42:49.042 --> 01:42:51.042
That is the purpose of prophecy.

703
01:42:51.042 --> 01:42:54.042
So when an unbeliever enters the church,

704
01:42:54.042 --> 01:42:58.042
he should not receive prophecy from whatever,

705
01:42:58.042 --> 01:43:01.042
he should receive prophecy from the gospel.

706
01:43:01.042 --> 01:43:03.042
That is true prophecy.

707
01:43:03.042 --> 01:43:06.042
25. For his deepest secrets will be revealed,

708
01:43:06.042 --> 01:43:09.042
and he will fall on his knees and worship God.

709
01:43:09.042 --> 01:43:13.042
How wonderful would it be if someone could prophesy about someone's life,

710
01:43:13.042 --> 01:43:17.042
just as Jesus prophesied about the woman at the well.

711
01:43:17.042 --> 01:43:19.042
I know that you have had five husbands,

712
01:43:19.042 --> 01:43:21.042
and the man you are now living with is not even...

713
01:43:21.042 --> 01:43:23.042
Wow, says that woman.

714
01:43:23.042 --> 01:43:25.042
This is a prophet.

715
01:43:25.042 --> 01:43:27.042
That is prophecy. How wonderful is that?

716
01:43:27.042 --> 01:43:30.042
Verse 26. What you must do,

717
01:43:30.042 --> 01:43:32.042
brothers and sisters,

718
01:43:32.042 --> 01:43:34.042
every time you come together,

719
01:43:34.042 --> 01:43:36.042
you all have received something from the Lord,

720
01:43:36.042 --> 01:43:38.042
to share with the other people.

721
01:43:38.042 --> 01:43:40.042
One comes with a song,

722
01:43:40.042 --> 01:43:42.042
another explains something about the Word,

723
01:43:42.042 --> 01:43:45.042
yet another shares something that God has shown him,

724
01:43:45.042 --> 01:43:47.042
and yet another speaks in the language of the Spirit,

725
01:43:47.042 --> 01:43:49.042
and also explains what that is.

726
01:43:49.042 --> 01:43:51.042
But everything must happen in such a way,

727
01:43:51.042 --> 01:43:54.042
that the others benefit from it.

728
01:43:54.042 --> 01:43:56.042
Can I get an amen on that?

729
01:43:56.042 --> 01:43:58.042
If people want to say something in the language of the Spirit,

730
01:43:58.042 --> 01:44:00.042
there should only be two or three.

731
01:44:00.042 --> 01:44:02.042
They must speak in turn,

732
01:44:02.042 --> 01:44:04.042
someone must explain it.

733
01:44:04.042 --> 01:44:06.042
If there is no one who can explain it,

734
01:44:06.042 --> 01:44:10.042
they should not speak in the languages of the Spirit to the congregation.

735
01:44:11.042 --> 01:44:15.042
They may speak to God in the language of the Spirit for themselves.

736
01:44:15.042 --> 01:44:18.042
Therefore, during the music and during the prayers,

737
01:44:18.042 --> 01:44:21.042
I love to pray in the languages of the Spirit.

738
01:44:21.042 --> 01:44:23.042
I love it.

739
01:44:23.042 --> 01:44:25.042
And then I just put my microphone away,

740
01:44:25.042 --> 01:44:27.042
and then it just goes well,

741
01:44:27.042 --> 01:44:29.042
during the music,

742
01:44:29.042 --> 01:44:31.042
while no one can hear me,

743
01:44:31.042 --> 01:44:33.042
for it is my language of the spirit,

744
01:44:33.042 --> 01:44:35.042
you have nothing to do with it.

745
01:44:35.042 --> 01:44:37.042
Unless the Holy Spirit wants,

746
01:44:37.042 --> 01:44:39.042
that you have something to do with it,

747
01:44:40.042 --> 01:44:42.042
Where was I?

748
01:44:43.042 --> 01:44:45.042
I will start from verse 29.

749
01:44:45.042 --> 01:44:47.042
Regarding the prophets,

750
01:44:47.042 --> 01:44:49.042
two or three may prophesy to the congregation.

751
01:44:49.042 --> 01:44:51.042
The others must examine whether it is correct.

752
01:44:51.042 --> 01:44:53.042
Very important, Montanists.

753
01:44:53.042 --> 01:44:59.042
For if God suddenly reveals something to someone else who is there,

754
01:44:59.042 --> 01:45:01.042
the others must keep silent.

755
01:45:01.042 --> 01:45:04.042
In this way, you can all prophesy one by one.

756
01:45:04.042 --> 01:45:07.042
Then everyone will benefit from it

757
01:45:07.042 --> 01:45:10.042
and they will be encouraged and built up by it.

758
01:45:10.042 --> 01:45:13.042
The prophets are in control of their own spirit,

759
01:45:13.042 --> 01:45:16.042
so they can be silent if necessary.

760
01:45:16.042 --> 01:45:22.042
For God is not a God of disorder, but of peace.

761
01:45:22.042 --> 01:45:27.042
As in other congregations, women must keep silent in the service.

762
01:45:27.042 --> 01:45:30.042
They should not sit and talk.

763
01:45:30.042 --> 01:45:34.042
They must remain obedient and modest towards their husband,

764
01:45:34.042 --> 01:45:38.042
for he is the head as it is stated in the law.

765
01:45:38.042 --> 01:45:40.042
This is different teaching.

766
01:45:40.042 --> 01:45:42.042
I would like to talk about this again.

767
01:45:42.042 --> 01:45:45.042
But this is not for today.

768
01:45:45.042 --> 01:45:47.042
But I can show you one thing.

769
01:45:47.042 --> 01:45:52.042
It says, as in all other congregations, women must keep silent in the service,

770
01:45:52.042 --> 01:45:54.042
they are not allowed to sit and talk.

771
01:45:54.042 --> 01:45:57.042
So that means in that time,

772
01:45:57.042 --> 01:46:00.042
and I recently had a question about this,

773
01:46:00.042 --> 01:46:04.042
in that time, under the Greek goddess Diana and Artemis,

774
01:46:04.042 --> 01:46:09.042
the culture of feminism, just like today,

775
01:46:09.042 --> 01:46:12.042
the culture of feminism was so strong,

776
01:46:12.042 --> 01:46:14.042
that women dressed provocatively,

777
01:46:14.042 --> 01:46:16.042
they wore their hair down,

778
01:46:16.042 --> 01:46:18.042
they had way too much makeup on,

779
01:46:18.042 --> 01:46:20.042
they had a very big mouth.

780
01:46:20.042 --> 01:46:24.042
The Greek goddess Diana was a goddess with all sorts of breasts.

781
01:46:24.042 --> 01:46:26.042
It was all very extravagant.

782
01:46:27.042 --> 01:46:30.042
And these women came to faith in the congregation,

783
01:46:30.042 --> 01:46:36.042
and sat in the congregation talking just as arrogantly and loudly.

784
01:46:36.042 --> 01:46:40.042
Talking loudly, dressing loudly, I should say.

785
01:46:40.042 --> 01:46:42.042
Just disturbing the order.

786
01:46:42.042 --> 01:46:46.042
And then Paul says, well what I showed some time ago on the whiteboard,

787
01:46:46.042 --> 01:46:48.042
with that creation order.

788
01:46:48.042 --> 01:46:50.042
Do you all remember that creation order?

789
01:46:50.042 --> 01:46:54.042
Father, son, holy spirit, man, woman, children, the congregation,

790
01:46:54.042 --> 01:46:56.042
you know what I mean.

791
01:46:56.042 --> 01:46:58.042
And what Paul is doing there is, those women,

792
01:46:58.042 --> 01:47:03.042
they were manifesting too much in that creation order.

793
01:47:03.042 --> 01:47:06.042
Big mouths, manipulative and dominant.

794
01:47:06.042 --> 01:47:10.042
And then Paul says, women, back in line.

795
01:47:10.042 --> 01:47:14.042
And then we can say, we find that annoying,

796
01:47:14.042 --> 01:47:16.042
I don't find that annoying.

797
01:47:16.042 --> 01:47:17.042
Haha.

798
01:47:17.042 --> 01:47:20.042
But we will talk about that again.

799
01:47:20.042 --> 01:47:24.042
And if they want to know something, they should ask their husband at home,

800
01:47:24.042 --> 01:47:29.042
because it is not proper for a woman to sit and talk loudly in the service.

801
01:47:29.042 --> 01:47:34.042
Brothers and sisters, the Word of God did not begin with you in Corinth, did it?

802
01:47:34.042 --> 01:47:36.042
It is not just for you, is it?

803
01:47:36.042 --> 01:47:39.042
Open church, the Holy Spirit is not just for you.

804
01:47:40.042 --> 01:47:44.042
Do you consider yourselves to be prophetic and spiritual people?

805
01:47:44.042 --> 01:47:45.042
Good.

806
01:47:45.042 --> 01:47:50.042
Then you will also be able to see that what I am saying here is a command from the Lord.

807
01:47:50.042 --> 01:47:55.042
But if people do not take this seriously, we do not have to take them seriously either.

808
01:47:55.042 --> 01:47:59.042
People who act strangely in the Holy Spirit do not need to be taken seriously.

809
01:47:59.042 --> 01:48:03.042
They are indeed acting foolishly.

810
01:48:03.042 --> 01:48:09.042
Shall we stand, for I want to pronounce these last two verses over us.

811
01:48:09.042 --> 01:48:13.042
So brothers and sisters, desire to prophesy.

812
01:48:14.042 --> 01:48:15.042
Just a moment.

813
01:48:16.042 --> 01:48:17.042
Is everyone standing?

814
01:48:24.042 --> 01:48:26.042
Last minute, focus.

815
01:48:27.042 --> 01:48:30.042
Brothers and sisters, desire to prophesy.

816
01:48:30.042 --> 01:48:32.042
Be filled with the Holy Spirit.

817
01:48:33.042 --> 01:48:37.042
Do not hinder speaking in tongues in the Spirit.

818
01:48:38.042 --> 01:48:44.042
But ensure that everything is done decently and in order.

819
01:48:44.042 --> 01:48:46.042
Can we close our eyes?

820
01:48:49.042 --> 01:48:52.042
Father in heaven, I thank you for your Word.

821
01:48:52.042 --> 01:48:59.042
I thank you that Paul has given direction to the marvelous wonder of Acts, chapter 2.

822
01:49:00.042 --> 01:49:07.042
Holy Spirit, I want to ask you to give us all direction.

823
01:49:07.042 --> 01:49:15.042
So that we can be wonderfully orderly, but in your way, at your level, through the Holy Spirit.

824
01:49:16.042 --> 01:49:24.042
For those people who may have been skeptical about the gifts of the Holy Spirit, while all eyes are closed.

825
01:49:25.042 --> 01:49:29.042
I want to take a moment right now to give you a moment.

826
01:49:30.042 --> 01:49:35.042
Be still for a moment and speak quietly to the Holy Spirit and lay this down.

827
01:49:37.042 --> 01:49:39.042
Say sorry to yourself if you have been skeptical.

828
01:49:40.042 --> 01:49:44.042
I am not talking about if you don't understand, if you are not the same as skeptical.

829
01:49:46.042 --> 01:49:48.042
Paul says in 1 Corinthians, chapter 14.

830
01:49:48.042 --> 01:49:53.042
Do not despise the things of the Spirit of God, do not hold it back.

831
01:49:55.042 --> 01:49:58.042
In English it says, don't quench the spirit.

832
01:49:59.042 --> 01:50:03.042
Don't throw water on the fire of the Holy Spirit.

833
01:50:04.042 --> 01:50:05.042
That's all babble.

834
01:50:06.042 --> 01:50:08.042
That's just religious nonsense.

835
01:50:09.042 --> 01:50:14.042
If these have been your words, then say sorry for that.

836
01:50:17.042 --> 01:50:21.042
Sorry Lord, I do not want to disappoint you.

837
01:50:21.042 --> 01:50:26.042
Sorry Lord, I want to be open to what you have done, but I did not understand it and therefore I was skeptical.

838
01:50:27.042 --> 01:50:31.042
I have spoken out of turn, I have said things about you that are not true, I am sorry.

839
01:50:32.042 --> 01:50:33.042
Come to God at this moment.

840
01:50:34.042 --> 01:50:37.042
Say sorry for the things you have said wrong about the Holy Spirit.

841
01:50:38.042 --> 01:50:40.042
We have read it loud and clear.

842
01:50:41.042 --> 01:50:42.042
It can't be any clearer.

843
01:50:42.042 --> 01:50:49.042
Holy Spirit, I want to ask you to touch the people of Open Church with your spirit, whether it is right now.

844
01:50:50.042 --> 01:50:55.042
Or later in the car on the way home, or tonight in bed, or tomorrow in the car on the way to work.

845
01:50:56.042 --> 01:51:00.042
Or in our personal prayers, in our little office, or in our bedrooms.

846
01:51:01.042 --> 01:51:04.042
Touch us with your Holy Spirit.

847
01:51:05.042 --> 01:51:08.042
And teach us to speak in the languages of the spirit.

848
01:51:08.042 --> 01:51:11.042
For the building up of my soul, as we have just read.

849
01:51:13.042 --> 01:51:17.042
And lastly, I want to say this, Holy Spirit, I want more of you.

850
01:51:18.042 --> 01:51:20.042
In Jesus' name. Amen.

851
01:51:21.042 --> 01:51:23.042
Shall we give Jesus a round of applause? Hallelujah.

852
01:51:28.042 --> 01:51:31.042
Dear people, lastly a short announcement.

853
01:51:31.042 --> 01:51:34.042
The summer camps, the registration form for the summer camps is open.

854
01:51:35.042 --> 01:51:39.042
That means you can register your children for the summer camps, or your teenagers.

855
01:51:40.042 --> 01:51:41.042
You also get a few days of rest again.

856
01:51:42.042 --> 01:51:43.042
And that is really nice.

857
01:51:44.042 --> 01:51:46.042
Those registration forms will remain open.

858
01:51:47.042 --> 01:51:49.042
Children and youth until July 1.

859
01:51:50.042 --> 01:51:54.042
Please help us by indicating your children before July 1.

860
01:51:55.042 --> 01:51:58.042
And also to pay, so that we can work with the budget for the summer camps,

861
01:51:58.042 --> 01:52:01.042
and the registrations can also organize things.

862
01:52:02.042 --> 01:52:06.042
The men's camp, that registration form will remain open until September 1.

863
01:52:07.042 --> 01:52:11.042
So men, you have a little more time from me to think about it.

864
01:52:12.042 --> 01:52:15.042
And if I don't see your name on that list, I'll come after you.

865
01:52:16.042 --> 01:52:19.042
Because real men go to real man camp. Amen?

866
01:52:20.042 --> 01:52:23.042
Be blessed today and see you tomorrow in prayer. Amen.

